  "description": "Watercolor Food Clipart, Summer Clipart, Summer Watercolor Food Clipart Pack, Summer Menu. Bring summer vibes to your creative projects with this watercolor summer food clipart bundle! This set includes 20 high-resolution PNG elements featuring juicy fruits, refreshing drinks, ice cream, hot dogs, and tropical treats. Each illustration is hand-painted with vibrant summer colors, perfect for planners, stickers, sublimation, scrapbooking, party invites, and more. \nYou will receive:\n– 20 individual PNG files;\n– Transparent background;\n– 300 DPI;\n– 4000 x 4000 px;\n– Instant Download;\n– All in 1 ZIP-folder.\n– Commercial use allowed.\nPlease note that this is a digital download ONLY, no physical product will be shipped.\nFast, easy and affordable – no shipping or waiting necessary. Purchase, Print and Enjoy!\nPerfect for:\n– For printing on dishes, textiles, T-shirt, mugs, phone cases, tote bags and any surfaces print\n– Planner covers, dashboards, etc.\n– For blog design\n– Greeting cards and invitations design\n– Physical or digital scrapbooking\n– Party backdrops\n– Phone wallpapers\n– Blog or web design\n– other DIY projects\nDiscover an array of captivating summer-themed illustrations in my store\nFollow me, save this product to your favorites, and stay informed about my latest projects.",
